meta {
  name: my packages
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/student/packages/
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  "My Packages": what was bought, how much of it is left, and when it expires.

  `classes_remaining`, `progress_percent`, `is_expired` and `can_book` are all
  computed. `can_book` is the one the UI should gate the "Book a class" button
  on -- it means paid, not expired, and at least one class left.

  `package_data` is the frozen copy of the package as it was at purchase, so
  later edits to the catalogue never rewrite someone's history.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "results": [
      {
        "id": "534a4812-5ff0-4ba1-a136-ab610f9c9e21",
